# robots.txt - your crawler and AI policy.
#
# Allow / Disallow control which crawlers may fetch which paths.
# Content-Signal declares intent for three distinct uses (set each yes or no):
#   ai-train  - using your content to train models
#   search    - indexing for search / answer engines
#   ai-input  - fetching at answer time to ground a response (RAG, citations)
# Disallowing a crawler or setting a signal to "no" removes you from that use.
# Decide each based on what you want agents to do with your content.

User-agent: *
Allow: /
Disallow: /auth/
Disallow: /sign-in
Disallow: /admin/

Content-Signal: ai-train=yes, search=yes, ai-input=yes

Sitemap: https://yourdomain.com/sitemap.xml
schemamap: https://yourdomain.com/schemamap.xml
